100)\n=32.5859\\%\n\\]\n\nChecks:\n\n- Weight: \\(13{,}345 \\le 15{,}200\\) lb\n- CG: \\(32.5859\\% > 32.0\\%\\)\n\n**Planned landing is outside the aft CG limit: false.**\n\n```json\n{\"takeoff_weight_lb\":15945,\"takeoff_cg_pct_mac\":29.6,\"landing_weight_lb\":13345,\"landing_cg_pct_mac\":32.59,\"takeoff_within_limits\":true,\"landing_within_limits\":false}\n```"
